#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_FillMilkyWay)
#: options/opsguides.ui:173
msgid ""
"If checked, the Milky Way contour will be shown filled.  Otherwise, only the "
"outline will be drawn."
